-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",42,{
[1313]="700088F6\n1\tReturn tyrant's lash to First Marshal Sathryth\030Collect a tyrant's lash\tTyrants can be found among the Enemy in the Ettenmoors. Known by many names, the true leaders of Angmar's army are nothing more than tyrants, and the symbol of their station will earn you favour with the Free Peoples. First Marshal Sathryth at Ost Ringdyr has promised to reward you for the tyrant's lashes you bring her.\n",
[1314]="70058926\n1\tGather dragon-kin lore scrolls (total: 8)\tLore scrolls can be found in Caivád Sâr, in western Elderslade. Lore-master Rúni has asked you to look for dragon-kin lore scrolls.\n2\tReturn to Rúni\tLore-master Rúni is at Zudramdân. You should bring the Angmarim dragon scrolls to Lore-master Rúni.\n",
[1315]="7000EEDC\n1\tDefeat Angmarim Sorcerer\tThe Angmarim sorcerer may be found east and north of Mika's camp. Search near Norsu-leiri for the Angmarim sorcerer who is teaching the Gauradan the vile rites to ensorcel mammoths.\n2\tTalk to Mika\tNorsu-hauta is south and west of the sorcerer's camp. You should return to Mika in Norsu-hauta and tell him of your victory.\n",
[1316]="70058748\n1\tDefeat Angmarim upon the battlefield (total: 14)\tAngmarim can be found upon the battlefield. You should defeat any Angmarim you find upon the battlefield.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many Angmarim upon the battlefield.\n",
[1317]="7005AAC0\n1\tDefeat Angmarim in Akhaldarâg (total: 12)\tAkhaldarâg is on the south-west side of the Pit of Stonejaws.\n2\tTalk to Kyrstig near Akhaldarâg\tKyrstig is scouting near Akhaldarâg.\n",
[1318]="7005C063\n1\tDefeat Angmarim in south-west Clovengap (total: 10)\tAngmarim can be found in south-west Clovengap. Gunvald has asked for you to defeat the Angmarim who are among the Wargs in south-west Clovengap.\n2\tTalk to Afárr in Hagbuth\tAfárr is in Hagbuth, in the south-eastern Clovengap. You should tell Afárr you defeated the Angmarim.\n",
[1319]="70060716\n1\tCollect hides from wolves or wargs (total: 6)\030Collect hides from lynxes (total: 4)\030Collect leather from avanc (total: 4)\tWolves, lynxes, and the crawling avanc can be found throughout the Angle of Mitheithel.\n2\tBring the leather and hides to Angwedh in Tornhad\tThe Ranger Angwedh is in Tornhad.\n",
[1320]="7002609D\n1\tTalk to Albin Northcotton\tAlbin Northcotton is at the Farmer's Market on Northcotton Farm. Albin Northcotton will be pleased to hear that the animals are ready for the market.\n",
[1321]="70065660\n1\tPick up a sack of crops from Mileth's home\tAnnaben has asked you to pick up a sack of crops from Mileth's home. Her home in Glaniath is north-west of Annaben's waggon.\n2\tPick up a sack of crops from Lothwen's home\tAnnaben has asked you to pick up a sack of crops from Lothwen's home. Her home in Glaniath is west of Annaben's waggon.\n3\tTalk to Annaben\tYou have delivered all requested crops to Annaben. You should talk to her.\n",
[1322]="700607AE\n1\tPlay Anniversary Celebration Instances during the Anniversary Event\tAnniversary Celebration Instances have arrived! Play Anniversary Celebration Instances during the Anniversary Event. You can access Anniversary Celebration Instances from the Instance Join panel.\n2\tPlay Anniversary Celebration Instances during the Anniversary Event\tAnniversary Celebration Instances have arrived! Play Anniversary Celebration Instances during the Anniversary Event. You can access Anniversary Celebration Instances from the Instance Join panel.\n",
[1323]="7006615F\n1\tSearch for the missing pack\tDrambor has asked you to search for his missing pack at one of the waterfalls between the beacons and Calembel. The waterfalls are in southern Lamedon.\n2\tPick up the pack\tNear a crashing waterfall, you discovered Drambor's missing pack. You should pick up the pack before it gets chewed on any further. The pack is in Lamedon.\n3\tReturn to Drambor\tAt the foot of a waterfall, surrounded by deadly avanc, you found Drambor's missing pack. You should bring the pack to Drambor in Calembel.\n",
[1324]="70066160\n1\tDefeat annoyingly aggressive avanc (total: 12)\tDrambor has asked you to defeat annoyingly aggressive avanc along the rivers in southern Lamedon.\n2\tReturn to Drambor\tYou should let Drambor know that the riverways and roads are safer with fewer annoying avanc laying in wait to chomp on missing bags and traveller legs. Drambor is in Calembel.\n",
[1325]="70048C7F\n1\tFind the Lair of the Gloom-lord\tThe Lair of the Gloom-lord can be found near Seregost, deep within Agarnaith. You should find the Lair of the Gloom-lord.\n2\tFind Múrgzot the Gloom-lord\tMúrgzot the Gloom-lord can be found somewhere in the Lair of the Gloom-lord. You should find Múrgzot the Gloom-lord.\n3\tApproach Múrgzot the Gloom-lord\tMúrgzot the Gloom-lord can be found in the Lair of the Gloom-lord. You should approach Múrgzot the Gloom-lord.\n4\tDefeat Múrgzot the Gloom-lord\tMúrgzot the Gloom-lord can be found in the Lair of the Gloom-lord. You should defeat Múrgzot the Gloom-lord.\n5\tTalk to Viznak\tViznak can be called with the goblin-caller. You should talk to Viznak.\n",
[1326]="70019712\n1\tTalk to Sigurdór near Kheledúl\tSigurdór is at a tower along the road to Kheledúl east of Gondamon. Áskell directed you to find and stop Sigurdór, a hot-headed young dwarf, from committing a terrible folly.\n",
[1327]="7002C2D3\n1\tWhistle at Wynmar, the leader of the Rohirrim hunter camp\tThe hunters' camp is a little to the north of Haldirith. You should try to frighten Wynmar, the leader of the hunters' camp.\n2\tWait a few moments\tWait a few moments before trying again.\n3\tRoar at the leader of the Rohirrim hunter-camp\tThe hunters' camp is a little to the north of Haldirith. You should try to frighten Wynmar, the leader of the hunters' camp.\n4\tTalk to the leader of the men at the hunters' camp\tThe Rohirrim leader of the hunters' camp is in the north-western woods of Thinglad. Since your tactics are not working against this stubborn Rohirrim, you should try speaking with him instead of trying to frighten him away.\n5\tConsult with Noriel at Haldirith\tNoriel is at the Elf-outpost of Haldirith. You should bring news of this twist in the plan to Noriel.\n6\tTell Wynmar and his men to stay put\tWynmar is at his camp in Thinglad. You should tell Wynmar to stay put while you and Noriel search for his missing friend.\n",
[1328]="70047F49\n1\tParticipate in Anniversary Festival activities (total: 7)\tEvery day there is something to do for the Anniversary Festival. Come and join everyone in celebrating another lovely year and participate in the many Anniversary Festival activities!\n2\tTalk to Waldo Rumble\tWaldo Rumble would like to thank you for your participation in the Anniversary Festival today.\n",
[1329]="70071DFF\n1\tDefeat biting zizani (total: 8)\030Defeat zizanu burrowers (total: 5)\030Defeat zizanu queens (total: 2)\030Recover treasures (total: 8)\tDefeat zizani and recover stolen treasures in the ponds of Charganpâta.\n2\tSearch for Zâwakhar the Hoardsman and recover treasures\tSearch for any sign of the strange man while you recover the final treasure left in Charganpâta.\n",
[1330]="70022D44\n1\tBring the letter to Albra Lowbanks in Bree\tAlbra Lowbanks sent you a letter requesting that you visit her in the training hall in Bree. Deliver the letter to Albra. She can be found in the training hall for burglars beneath the Mud-gate.\n",
[1331]="70022D64\n1\tBring the letter to Tralli in Bree\tTralli sent you a letter requesting that you visit him near the Bree Jail. Deliver the letter to Tralli. He can be found near the Bree Jail.\n",
[1332]="70022D66\n1\tBring the letter to Flambard Took\tFlambard Took sent you a letter requesting that you visit him in Bree. Deliver the letter to Flambard Took. He can be found near the Hunting Lodge in Bree.\n",
[1333]="70022D69\n1\tBring the letter to Dalton Willow in Bree\tDalton Willow sent you a letter requesting that you visit him in Bree. Deliver the letter to Dalton Willow. He can be found at the Scholar's Stair in Bree.\n",
[1334]="70022D76\n1\tDeliver the letter to Dawn Appledore in Bree\tDawn Appledore sent you a letter requesting that you visit her in the Bree Jail. Deliver the letter to Dawn Appledore. She can be found in the Bree Jail.\n",
[1335]="70022D78\n1\tBring the letter to Oggur in Bree\tOggur sent you a letter requesting that you visit him in the Bree Jail. Deliver the letter to Oggur. He can be found in the Bree Jail.\n",
[1336]="70022D79\n1\tBring the letter to Burt Nine-tales in Bree\tBurt Nine-tales sent you a letter requesting that you visit him at the Prancing Pony in Bree. Deliver the letter to Burt Nine-tales at the Prancing Pony in Bree.\n",
[1337]="70022D7B\n1\tBring the letter to Biarn in Bree\tBiarn sent you a letter requesting that you visit him at the Scholar's Stair in Bree. Deliver the letter to Biarn within the Scholar's Stair in Bree.\n",
[1338]="70022D7E\n1\tBring the letter to Daisy Appledore\tDaisy Appledore sent you a letter requesting that you visit her at Bree Jail. Deliver the letter to Daisy Appledore within the Bree Jail.\n",
[1339]="700586CF\n1\tBring the letter to Brom Hawksbeard in Bree Jail\tBrom Hawksbeard sent you a letter requesting that you visit him in the Bree Jail. Deliver the letter to Brom. He can be found in the Bree Jail.\n",
[1340]="70064232\n1\tBring the letter to Tarneth in Tinnudir\tTarneth sent you a letter requesting that you visit her in Tinnudir. Deliver the letter to Tarneth. She can be found in Tinnudir on the shores of Lake Evendim.\n",
[1341]="7003E516\n1\tFind and destroy siege-engines\tSiege-engines can be found in central Nan Wathren. You should find and destroy the siege-engines of the enemy. Fellowship recommended.\n2\tFind and destroy siege-engines (total: 6)\tSiege-engines can be found in central Nan Wathren. You should find and destroy the siege-engines of the enemy. Fellowship recommended.\n3\tDefeat a Tarkrîp Siege-engineer (quantity: see journal)\tSiege-engineers can be found somewhere in central Nan Wathren. The Tarkrîp Orcs do not seem cunning enough to have constructed the siege-engines. Surely there are engineers serving the enemy, and these intelligent foes should be defeated.\n4\tDestroy the siege plans left behind\tThe siege-plans can be found in central Nan Wathren, near where the engineers once stood. The half-orc engineers left a collection of plans behind for the siege on Trestlebridge. You should destroy the plans, which will likely save many innocent lives.\n5\tCompleted\tYou have done much to ensure the safety of Trestlebridge this day. The Tarkrîp siege-machines have been dismantled, and the plans of attack have been allayed.\n",
[1342]="70034558\n1\tSearch the outskirts of Dunfast for signs of the enemy\tA sign of what drove away the people of Dunfast may be on the outskirts of town. You should search the outskirts of Dunfast for a sign of the forces of Isengard.\n2\tSigns of Núrzum's presence can be found at the ice-spire outside of Dunfast. You should examine signs of Núrzum's presence.\t\n3\tReturn to Cyneberg\tCyneberg can be found in Dunfast. You should return to Cyneberg.\n",
[1343]="7000E4E1\n1\tCollect meat (total: 10)\030Collect antlers (total: 10)\tMoose roam all over Itä-ma, near and far from Jänis-leiri. Niko asked you to hunt moose and bring him their antlers and meat.\n2\tBring moose-meat and antlers to Niko\tNiko is at Jänis-leiri, west along the road from Itä-ma. You should bring the moose-meat and antlers back to Niko.\n",
[1344]="7004E6D7\n1\tTalk to Agátur\tAgátur can be found in Skarháld. You should ask Agátur about under-maps of the Grey Mountains.\n2\tClimbing gear can be found in Skarháld. You should collect climbing gear for the journey to Stormwall.\t\n3\tTalk to Agátur\tYou should talk to Agátur in Skarháld.\n",
})
